{"title":"Hill Giant Youth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 13 Hill Giant that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (4.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/giants-knucklebone\">Giants Knucklebone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth?lv=11\">Lv 11 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth?lv=13\">Lv 13 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth?lv=14\">Lv 14 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth?lv=15\">Lv 15 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth?lv=11\" title=\"Pick level 11\"><td><b>11</b></td><td>34</td><td>10.6</td><td>550</td><td class=\"muted\">102 · 14.8 · 1,650</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/King%20Jordon's%20Tomb\">King Jordon&#39;s Tomb</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth?lv=12\" title=\"Pick level 12\"><td><b>12</b></td><td>37</td><td>11.1</td><td>600</td><td class=\"muted\">111 · 15.5 · 1,800</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth?lv=13\" title=\"Pick level 13\"><td><b>13</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>40</td><td>11.7</td><td>650</td><td class=\"muted\">120 · 16.4 · 1,950</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/King%20Jordon's%20Tomb\">King Jordon&#39;s Tomb</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth?lv=14\" title=\"Pick level 14\"><td><b>14</b></td><td>43</td><td>12.2</td><td>700</td><td class=\"muted\">129 · 17.1 · 2,100</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>15</b></td><td>46</td><td>12.8</td><td>750</td><td class=\"muted\">138 · 17.9 · 2,250</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Rustpick%20Mine\">Rustpick Mine</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"hill-giant-youth\" data-map-level=\"15\">Show level 15 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 6 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 6 looted corpses, 30 recorded drops, 468 total, 7–39 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/6</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"iron-mace\" title=\"Iron Mace - in 33% of 6 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/65a7b2289a7b972f05ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Iron Mace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 2/6</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 2 of 2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"iron-warmace\" title=\"Iron Warmace - in 17% of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c50f7826f0e8f3250cc6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Iron Warmace</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">17% · 1/6</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"deerhide-head\" title=\"Deerhide Head - in 17% of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/1a50bfef1d67f314d5cd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Deerhide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">17% · 1/6</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Crude: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"leather-armor\" title=\"Leather Armor - in 17% of 6 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/079f18acc1911aed6e37.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Leather Armor</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">17% · 1/6</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dr